The exact non-ranking statuses are
\[
\begin{aligned}
\mathcal C_{\mathrm{res}}:\quad&
\left(
\begin{gathered}
\mathrm{A0\_WEAK\_ARITHMETIC\_RELATION},\ \mathrm{A1\_FAIL},\\
\mathrm{A2\_FAIL},\ \mathrm{A3\_FAIL},\ \mathrm{A4\_FAIL}
